62cm　Birthday: August 12　Blood Type: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A junior from the protagonist’s university, who became tied to him through a certain event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After graduation, she joined the same company where he works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always acting like the “junior,” she’s proactive but can’t take the decisive step forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her specialty is causing trouble for the protagonist, and she hates overtime the most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991720/extras/384db12349ec9b9554297d458e48f0bf.avif?t=1772093360\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲Yoko Ando</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Shiki Asagi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height: 150cm　Birthday: October 15　Blood Type: A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ryoko’s younger sister and Michiru’s classmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright and energetic girl, though sometimes just as careless as her older sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her biggest concern is that her height hasn’t grown at all since her first year of junior high.</p>",
